WingChat Squen diagram
Components:
	User
	WingBank app
	VoIP SDK/PWA
	Wing VoIP Backend
	Subscriber management
	Mediatel Backend/Telephony server
Flow:
1. [User] Open using [WingBank app]
2. [User] open [VoIP SDK/PWA] app through [WingBank app] passing following data
- in case full login or patial login passing master_account_id, phone_number....
- incase unautenticated pass uuid, phone number .... 
3. [VoIP SDK/PWA] send data to [Wing VoIP Backend]
4. [Wing VoIP Backend] validate and send data to [Subscriber management]
5. [Subscriber management] issue and response back auth token to [Wing VoIP Backend]
6. [Wing VoIP Backend] response back auth token to [VoIP SDK/PWA]
7. [User(VoIP SDK/PWA)] intialize VoIP call to [Mediatel Backend/Telephony server]
8. [Mediatel Backend/Telephony server] response back ok
9. [VoIP SDK/PWA] Place VoIP call to [Mediatel Backend/Telephony server]
10. User in call action mute/unmute , send DTMF, hangup to [Mediatel Backend/Telephony server]
11. when call end [Mediatel Backend/Telephony server] response back call and agent info to [VoIP SDK/PWA]
12. [VoIP SDK/PWA] show rating UI
13. [VoIP SDK/PWA] send rating request to [Wing VoIP Backend]
14. end
