WingChat Squen diagram
Components:
	User
	WingBank app
	WingChat
	WingChat Backend
	Google Firebase
	Mediatel Server
	Mediatel Agent app
	Agent
Flow:
1. [User] Open using [WingBank app]
2. [User] open [Wingchat] app through [WingBank app] passing following data
- in case full login or patial login passing master_account_id, phone_number....
- incase unautenticated pass uuid, phone number .... 
3. [WingChat] send data to [WingChat Backend]
4. [WingChat backend] lookup for profile 
- in case exist return custom token back to [WingChat]
- in case not exist create profile then return custom token back to [WingChat]
5. [WingChat] send custom token to [Google Firebase] then [Google Firebase] response back Id token, refresh token to [WingChat]
6. [WingChat(user)] send message to [WingChat Backend] 
7. [WingChat backend] forward message to [Mediatel Server]
8. [Mediatel Server] forward message to [Mediatel Agent app]

9.[Agent] reply message in [Mediatel Agent app]
10. [Mediatel Agent app] forward to [Mediatel Server]
11. [Mediatel Server] send message to [WingChat Backend] 
12. [WingChat Backend] response back to [WingChat]
